Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), python3, dh-python, pybuild-plugin-pyproject
Standards-Version: 4.7.0
Homepage: https://github.com/e-allora/vox-debian

Package: vox
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, python3, speech-dispatcher
Recommends: python3-pymupdf, python3-ebooklib
Suggests: python3-mistune, python3-yaml
Description: CLI TTS reader using Piper neural text-to-speech
 Vox reads text, markdown, PDF, and EPUB files aloud using
 the Piper neural TTS engine via Speech Dispatcher.
 .
 Features:
  - Support for .txt, .md, .pdf, .epub files
  - Interactive controls: pause, resume, seek, quit
  - Voice and rate customization
  - Works on headless systems
